      "widgets_values": [
        "Text to Speech:\nType the text you want to be spoken, and the model will generate audio using the voice you have loaded.\n\nVoice Change:\nThis feature attempts to change the voice in any newly uploaded audio file to match the original target voice you uploaded in the previous section.\n\nNote: The maximum audio length should not exceed 30–45 seconds.\n\nRemove Background Sounds and Voice Change:\nThis option will isolate the speakers from any newly uploaded audio file, remove background sounds, and change the voice to match the original target voice you uploaded in the previous section. This feature works especially well for songs or audio with background music.\n\nNote: The maximum audio length should not exceed 30–45 seconds, or you may encounter issues during processing."
      ],
